# --- Agent tooling (vendored by `npx impeccable install`) ---
# Nine near-identical ~3.4MB copies of the same installed skill, one per
# agent harness. Reproducible with `npx impeccable install`; not project source.
.agent/
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.kiro/
.pi/

# --- Impeccable working state ---
# .impeccable/world/ and decision-payload.json are deliberately NOT ignored:
# the board and hero images are the visual reference DESIGN.md is built on,
# and the payload records how that world was chosen.
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/live/
.impeccable/cache/

